Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.76,0:00:03.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Go and be frozen, Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.22,0:00:06.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who is this? Another new person?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.84,0:00:10.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You look literally speechless.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.84,0:00:12.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What is it that you seek?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.76,0:00:15.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Wh-Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.39,0:00:17.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.05,0:00:21.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,How interesting. Then this\Nmust also be {\i1}their{\i0} will.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.05,0:00:24.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Will"? "Their"?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.68,0:00:26.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Very well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.18,0:00:28.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.47,0:00:36.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.76,0:00:38.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Setsu...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.18,0:00:39.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I guess you're already awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.76,0:00:43.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Well? Do you understand a little bit\Nafter the instant learning?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.14,0:00:45.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.68,0:00:49.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Is this some sort of sabotage?\NDon't think you'll get away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.05,0:00:53.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.64,0:00:54.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yuriko.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.01,0:00:57.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I don't know much about her either,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.30,0:00:59.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,but she's apparently a shrine maiden\Nfrom a sublight-speed ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.30,0:02:35.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Jina? Jina's not here...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.55,0:02:37.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Okay, it looks like we're all present.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.09,0:02:40.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Then let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.89,0:02:42.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Where's Jina?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.34,0:02:45.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Jina? Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.14,0:02:49.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It appears as though your\Nmemories are still confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.26,0:02:55.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I guess this means that she never{\i0}\N{\i1}escaped onto this ship in this world line.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.59,0:02:59.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Er, um... Sorry. My mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.64,0:03:04.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So, like... Why's she sitting over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.43,0:03:05.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Talk about intense. Yeesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.97,0:03:09.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You are the narrator of this play, are you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.22,0:03:12.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Then let the curtain rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.72,0:03:13.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.97,0:03:18.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,According to LeVi's report, one\NGnosia has infiltrated this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.22,0:03:22.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But we don't know which of us it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.22,0:03:26.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- Did you wanna just draw lots to decide?\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.64,0:03:29.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So I'm back to the beginning again.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.93,0:03:33.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Jina's not here, and there's{\i0}\N{\i1}another new person.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.51,0:03:35.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Considering the conditions have changed,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.22,0:03:37.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}there's no way to tell who the Gnosia is.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.43,0:03:42.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not to mention, what's the point{\i0}\N{\i1}of even finding the Gnosia anyway?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.34,0:03:45.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When I had to return to the start{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.68,0:03:49.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}because I failed to get rid of the{\i0}\N{\i1}Gnosia, I still had some hope.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.22,0:03:52.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I believed that if we{\i0}\N{\i1}could get rid of the Gnosia,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.84,0:03:54.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I could escape from this loop.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.76,0:03:59.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But even though I identified the Gnosia and{\i0}\N{\i1}succeeded in sending them into cold sleep,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.34,0:04:01.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the loop restarted anyway.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.59,0:04:04.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm back to the first day.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.84,0:04:08.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I have to repeat the same first day{\i0}\N{\i1}whether the ship gets taken over{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.84,0:04:11.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}by the Gnosia or we succeed{\i0}\N{\i1}in eliminating them,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.43,0:04:13.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}there's no point in this meeting.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.14,0:04:16.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You'll know soon enough.\NSo I want you to do your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.97,0:04:19.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,For everyone's sake... and for your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.18,0:04:22.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You say that, but...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.51,0:04:26.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What's up? You're zoning out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.76,0:04:29.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It doesn't seem that they\Nwere listening at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.84,0:04:31.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Just look at that moronic face.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.68,0:04:33.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Er, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.76,0:04:37.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'd like to hear what you think, Yuri.\NThat's what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.55,0:04:42.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Er, um... Honestly, I'm not\Nreally sure right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.80,0:04:46.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It must be convenient to be an amnesiac.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.14,0:04:50.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Are you unsure as to whom we should suspect?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.39,0:04:52.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.26,0:04:54.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You will do just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.72,0:04:55.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.26,0:04:57.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.51,0:05:00.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, wait a sec! Why me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.09,0:05:04.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Are you wearing that suspicious\Nmask to hide your lies?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.72,0:05:10.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Your demeanor has been rather restless\Nsince we arrived, your glances furtive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.68,0:05:12.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Th-This is just how I am, bud!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.22,0:05:17.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You have only yourself to curse\Nfor your own carelessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.22,0:05:18.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Begone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.09,0:05:21.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It is time.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.34,0:05:22.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Wha—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.43,0:05:29.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Voting has completed. Seven valid votes.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.51,0:05:31.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The voting rate is 100%.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.76,0:05:43.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.22,0:05:47.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}One statement from her{\i0}\N{\i1}was enough to sway everyone.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.18,0:05:52.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Out of everyone so far, she may have{\i0}\N{\i1}the most command over the situation.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.97,0:05:56.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}According to Setsu, she's{\i0}\N{\i1}apparently a shrine maiden.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.59,0:05:59.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wonder if she knows anything about me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.14,0:06:11.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Huh? You wanna know about Yuriko?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.89,0:06:14.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I heard that she was a shrine maiden,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.18,0:06:16.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,but I was wondering if you\Nknew anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.22,0:06:18.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Ooh! Lookie, lookie!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.93,0:06:21.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Isn't this color super adorbs?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.55,0:06:24.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.39,0:06:27.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, despite how I look,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.76,0:06:30.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,cute li'l SQ has been out\Nin the world for only a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.72,0:06:32.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'm just a wittle one-year-old!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.59,0:06:34.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So I don't weally know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.93,0:06:37.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Did you grow up really sheltered or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.30,0:06:39.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.14,0:06:44.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That's more true than you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.09,0:06:47.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I mean, just look how flawless my skin is!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.14,0:06:48.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.72,0:06:54.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So that's the sublight-speed ship Hoshibune.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.72,0:06:58.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They pray as they drift through space...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.55,0:07:01.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What are you snooping around for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.22,0:07:08.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Your eyes... I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.97,0:07:11.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Very well. A change of scenery is in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.76,0:07:12.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.55,0:07:18.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,This place will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.72,0:07:22.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Behold. Can you see the stars stretching\Nto the furthest reaches of the cosmos?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.97,0:07:23.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.22,0:07:26.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Those same stars are watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.26,0:07:29.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,They see through you completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.34,0:07:34.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that you\Nknow something about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.64,0:07:39.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.72,0:07:41.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Should I answer her?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.47,0:07:46.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But if I do, she might use{\i0}\N{\i1}what I say to manipulate me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.80,0:07:54.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,How laughable.\NIt seems you know nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.84,0:07:59.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,No matter. Whether you like it or not,\Nyou will soon be forced to come to terms...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.18,0:08:00.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,with your own distortion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.51,0:08:19.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What was that just now?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.51,0:08:23.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Distortion"? I'm distorted? Me?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.05,0:08:29.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Warp commencing in ten, nine, eight...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.22,0:08:54.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.93,0:08:57.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'm back...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.34,0:09:02.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I was attacked by the Gnosia during warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.30,0:09:04.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,In your previous loop?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.18,0:09:06.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.01,0:09:11.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,"Loop"? How do you know about the loops?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.68,0:09:13.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,This is still the first day, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.97,0:09:15.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It is, but....
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.64,0:09:21.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You have that thing, too, Setsu?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.05,0:09:26.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I guess your loops have only just begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.76,0:09:29.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Let's exchange information. Take yours out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.84,0:09:31.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Take it out...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.72,0:09:33.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I guess you don't know how to do that either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.43,0:09:36.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Just imagine the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.30,0:09:43.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.89,0:09:47.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So you still don't know\Nwhy the loops are happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.05,0:09:49.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You mean you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.34,0:09:53.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.09,0:09:55.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'll explain everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.51,0:09:59.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who gave it to you, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.93,0:10:07.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Racio will be put into cold sleep.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.47,0:10:14.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So this is what you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.34,0:10:17.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't necessarily say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.84,0:10:20.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I just figured it would be nice and calm\Nand a good place to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.51,0:10:25.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It's a bit too lonely for me.\NDo you mind if I change it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.26,0:10:26.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.80,0:10:29.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,LeVi, pattern E-7, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.34,0:10:30.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Understood.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.09,0:10:42.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Wow, I didn't know it could do stuff like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.26,0:10:45.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Space is pretty desolate,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.84,0:10:48.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,so I prefer somewhere with a bit of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.34,0:10:49.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.84,0:10:50.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.30,0:10:54.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It's nothing. I just didn't know you\Nliked lively settings like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.14,0:10:57.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Wh-Who cares if I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.55,0:10:59.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's talk about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.34,0:11:02.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,This is a Silver Key.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.18,0:11:05.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It's a lifeform that implants into a human,\Ncausing them to be reborn in a loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.34,0:11:06.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,A lifeform?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.01,0:11:11.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, Racio did mention\Nthat there were lifeforms like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.26,0:11:13.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.47,0:11:14.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Why are you smiling?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.97,0:11:16.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,No, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.76,0:11:19.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So does this mean that you're also...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.59,0:11:22.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'm also looping.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.18,0:11:26.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But the two of us are\Nlooping at different rates,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.97,0:11:28.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,and across different world lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.93,0:11:32.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,For example, you're still on your fifth loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.47,0:11:34.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I've already looped over a hundred times.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.05,0:11:36.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,A hundred...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.59,0:11:40.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yes. All to fill the Silver Key\Nwith knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.14,0:11:45.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,They crave any kind of\Nknowledge about humans,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.22,0:11:48.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,and they make their hosts\Nloop in order to collect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.34,0:11:50.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Take a closer look.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.55,0:11:55.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,This is how much knowledge\NI've gathered so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.14,0:11:57.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That's what you need to do—\Nfill the Silver Key.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.26,0:12:02.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.93,0:12:13.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what the?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.55,0:12:14.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.64,0:12:18.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,We grilled them for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.51,0:12:20.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What are those?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.80,0:12:23.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Apparently, they're called dango.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.18,0:12:28.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Mitarashi dango...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.09,0:12:30.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The most supreme food.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.01,0:12:35.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,How'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.51,0:12:38.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I didn't really find out much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.43,0:12:41.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I guess I know what Jina's favorite\Nfood is now, if nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.80,0:12:44.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That's plenty. Try taking it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.97,0:12:53.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So this is the knowledge it seeks.\NIf I can satisfy its desire...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.43,0:12:56.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Oh, Yuri and Setsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.84,0:13:00.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,These are lovely flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.59,0:13:01.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.76,0:13:05.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'm planning to experiment a bit more\Nand make even more colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.80,0:13:10.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What do you like, Stella?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.26,0:13:11.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.55,0:13:15.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,There are even more in my room.\NWould you like to see them?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.34,0:13:17.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Sure. I'll stop by later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.26,0:13:19.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yes. You should come as well, Setsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.72,0:13:20.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.55,0:13:28.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.05,0:13:34.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Did you already find out that Stella\Nliked flowers in a previous loop?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.59,0:13:37.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Does it not count if I already knew about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.55,0:13:38.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.93,0:13:42.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The Silver Key's goal is to learn\Nabout humans on a deeper level.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.18,0:13:46.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,To learn about their personalities,\Ntheir words, where they came from,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.34,0:13:47.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,what they like or dislike,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.09,0:13:50.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,their hidden desires,\Ntheir dreams for the future...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.72,0:13:52.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Whatever information you're\Nable to glean from them
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.84,0:13:55.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,will be stored by the\NSilver Key as knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.05,0:14:01.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,And once it gets all of\Nthe knowledge it desires,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.51,0:14:06.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,the Silver Key will leave its host\Nand head to another dimension
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.22,0:14:07.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,to find a new host.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.59,0:14:10.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Another dimension?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.84,0:14:13.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yeah. That's the really important part—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.26,0:14:17.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,and the solution to the problem\Nyou're currently facing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.34,0:14:20.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You don't have to think about it\Ntoo much right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.97,0:14:23.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Just focus on gaining more knowledge
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.68,0:14:28.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,by getting closer to your crewmates\Nand asking them questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.09,0:14:30.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,For your own sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.34,0:14:32.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.01,0:14:35.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That's why the meetings still matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.97,0:14:38.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The longer you survive,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.14,0:14:42.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,the longer you'll be around the others, and\Nthe more chances you'll have to talk to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.18,0:14:44.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But whenever I loop and go back,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.26,0:14:46.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'll have to start over from my\Nfirst meeting with each of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.93,0:14:47.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.97,0:14:51.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That's why you should aim\Nto play your role as best you can
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.68,0:14:53.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,and survive as long as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.01,0:14:56.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Even if you know you'll eventually\Nhave to loop anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.43,0:14:58.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.47,0:15:02.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ten minutes until warp.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.55,0:15:04.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please return to your rooms.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.39,0:15:07.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,All right, LeVi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.76,0:15:12.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Thanks. For a while, I didn't know what\Nto do, but now I have a little hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.89,0:15:15.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we're together on this loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.97,0:15:20.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Let's eliminate the Gnosia and do our\Nbest to survive as long as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.89,0:15:23.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'm going back to my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.34,0:15:25.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.51,0:15:30.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.26,0:15:38.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Do you know why, on all of my loops until\Nnow, I never told you I was also looping?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.30,0:15:41.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.55,0:15:45.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It's because there was always a chance\Nyou were infected by the Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.47,0:15:48.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,No one wants to give\Ninformation to their enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.47,0:15:53.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But I know for sure that you're\Na human this time, Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.14,0:15:56.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Because I'm a Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.93,0:16:04.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Setsu...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.84,0:16:21.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Setsu is... a Gnosia...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.39,0:16:27.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Warp commencing in ten, nine, eight...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.26,0:16:40.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yuri...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.22,0:16:43.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So that means SQ was...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.47,0:16:46.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Correct. I am unable to sense SQ's presence.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.64,0:16:49.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me I failed again...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.68,0:16:52.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Why do you sound so despondent?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.05,0:16:57.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It was clear this would happen yesterday\Nwhen we failed to eliminate the Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.05,0:17:01.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but... someone lost their life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.64,0:17:03.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That is not a certainty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.01,0:17:07.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It is true that the Gnosia\Nattack and eliminate humans,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.93,0:17:10.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,but it's also said that they\Ndon't actually take their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.89,0:17:14.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,They might simply transfer\Ntheir souls elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.14,0:17:15.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.64,0:17:17.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,We don't really know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.80,0:17:19.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That sounds... worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.18,0:17:21.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Jina...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.72,0:17:26.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'd rather take my own life\Nthan be eliminated by a Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.59,0:17:28.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Hmph. Do as you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.09,0:17:31.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,In any case, we are out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.34,0:17:33.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Let us decide on the next sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.64,0:17:37.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,One Gnosia has infiltrated the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.34,0:17:42.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yesterday, Racio was put into cold sleep,\Nand SQ was attacked during the warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.34,0:17:45.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Those are the facts that we currently have.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.51,0:17:48.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That is correct.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.68,0:17:50.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Is there an Engineer?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.47,0:17:52.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}One has been appointed, but...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.68,0:17:55.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Looks like no one's going to out themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.51,0:17:58.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Apparently, we'll just have to discuss\Nwho the next sacrifice will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.30,0:18:01.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Yuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.18,0:18:05.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Huh? Me? I honestly don't know yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.93,0:18:08.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Is there anyone you think is suspicious?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.51,0:18:10.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is Setsu trying to do?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.43,0:18:13.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why did they tell me that they were a Gnosia?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.47,0:18:15.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Do they want me to pick them?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.47,0:18:16.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Or...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.97,0:18:20.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It appears as though the most appropriate\Nmeasure is to suspect Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.64,0:18:23.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Let us proceed by freezing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.72,0:18:24.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.89,0:18:28.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Calm down. If I panic and argue back,{\i0}\N{\i1}it'll be seen as an admission of guilt.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.22,0:18:31.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I can't say I'm happy that\Nyou think of me that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.97,0:18:34.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I was just being honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.43,0:18:35.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Oho...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.47,0:18:37.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It's because I asked them a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.97,0:18:40.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yuri was simply answering me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.80,0:18:41.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.14,0:18:47.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Is it all right if I confirm something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.59,0:18:49.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Setsu and Yuri...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.64,0:18:53.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Is what you were discussing last night true?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.22,0:18:56.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.80,0:18:59.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I heard you say it yourself, Setsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.59,0:19:01.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That you are a Gnosia...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.76,0:19:04.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Oho. Well, this is quite an\Nentertaining development.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.68,0:19:05.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.76,0:19:09.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm certain Yuri\Nheard them say it, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.26,0:19:11.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Well? What say you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.22,0:19:23.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.64,0:19:30.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Setsu is a Gnosia...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.97,0:19:43.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Voting has completed. Five valid votes.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.34,0:19:45.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The voting rate is 100%.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.51,0:19:47.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The votes will now be tallied.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.76,0:19:55.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It has been decided.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.51,0:19:58.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stella will be put into cold sleep.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.89,0:20:09.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But why...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.84,0:20:14.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I told you I was the Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.80,0:20:16.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Why did you lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.22,0:20:19.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I could ask you the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.26,0:20:20.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.34,0:20:24.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,When suspicion fell upon me during\Nthe meeting, why did you defend me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.93,0:20:27.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I know who you really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.80,0:20:29.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.47,0:20:32.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Why did you tell me at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.80,0:20:36.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure. But I think\NI just wanted to know...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.97,0:20:40.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,what you would do if you\Nknew if I was a Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.55,0:20:41.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,How'd that turn out?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.93,0:20:46.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Exactly how I thought it would.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.14,0:20:51.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You're calm and yet a bit lonely—\Njust like this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.18,0:20:56.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But I really wish you wouldn't do things\Nthat put you at a disadvantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.80,0:20:59.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You're only going to make yourself suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.34,0:21:01.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That goes for you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.01,0:21:07.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The last thing a Gnosia should do\Nis come out and say they are one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.30,0:21:09.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.84,0:21:17.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Tonight, when we warp, I want you\Nto attack and eliminate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.26,0:21:19.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.47,0:21:22.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'd feel too bad for Stella otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.05,0:21:24.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I ended up helping the Gnosia, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.30,0:21:28.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.97,0:21:31.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But just promise me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.26,0:21:35.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,No matter the world line, I want you\Nto play your role to the best of your ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.68,0:21:41.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,If you think I'm suspicious,\NI don't care how much you attack me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.39,0:21:44.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So that we can break these\Nloops once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.97,0:21:51.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Same to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.76,0:22:04.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.80,0:22:06.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.34,0:22:11.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Eight of us have escaped onto this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.76,0:22:16.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Me, you, Racio, Jina, Stella, Yuriko,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.47,0:22:17.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,and...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.55,0:22:23.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Hm?

